# ===================================================
# MANGSHESSIAN AI: MASTER .GITIGNORE FILE
# ===================================================

# 1. THE SECURITY FIREWALL
# What it is: The hidden file storing your private FRED API key.
# Why block it: Hackers scrape GitHub 24/7 for exposed API keys. 
# If uploaded, your key will be stolen instantly, locking you out or spamming the Fed.
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# 2. THE SYSTEM EXHAUST (PYTHON)
# What it is: Background "bytecode" files Python creates to run slightly faster.
# Why block it: These are specific to your physical laptop's hardware. 
# They are useless to the cloud and just pollute your repository with unreadable garbage.
__pycache__/

# 3. THE SYSTEM EXHAUST (MAC OS)
# What it is: A hidden Mac system file that remembers folder window sizes and icon positions.
# Why block it: It has nothing to do with your code. If you ever open this folder on a Mac, 
# the OS will change this file and falsely trigger a Git update, which is incredibly annoying.
.DS_Store